WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.000
The giant Jalut stood on the battlefield, shouting his challenge. He was huge, his voice was thunder, and the soldiers trembled with fear.

2
00:00:09.400 --> 00:00:14.728
But the young shepherd Dawud stepped forward. Let me try. Allah is with me.

3
00:00:15.128 --> 00:00:21.080
Dawud wanted no armor and no sword. He took only his sling and a few smooth little stones.

4
00:00:21.480 --> 00:00:26.880
Dawud swung his sling. The stone flew and struck Jalut. The giant fell.

5
00:00:27.280 --> 00:00:31.840
The people cheered. Dawud looked up at the sky and gave the victory to Allah.

6
00:00:32.240 --> 00:00:36.512
Allah made Dawud a king, and gave him wisdom and a beautiful voice.

7
00:00:36.912 --> 00:00:43.440
True strength is not about being big and tall. It is about having courage and trusting in Allah.
